WEBVTT

01:41.400 --> 01:45.979
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.530 --> 01:48.920
[Episode 25]

02:02.350 --> 02:03.350
Su Yu has many

02:03.400 --> 02:04.560
Immortal Masters under his command.

02:05.060 --> 02:05.970
Among the three guards,

02:06.000 --> 02:06.590
there might be

02:06.590 --> 02:07.350
someone like Feng

02:07.370 --> 02:08.410
with sharp eyes.

02:09.240 --> 02:10.050
If you can avoid using spiritual power,

02:10.080 --> 02:10.800
it's best to.

02:25.079 --> 02:25.870
I have a plan.

02:50.350 --> 02:52.740
[Huixiang Spring]

03:10.430 --> 03:11.710
If you make a sound and attract others,

03:12.080 --> 03:13.210
don't blame me for being merciless.

03:14.360 --> 03:15.080
Her skills

03:15.800 --> 03:17.470
have surpassed mine by so much.

03:18.590 --> 03:19.470
What do you want?

03:20.590 --> 03:22.030
Why did Su Yu capture my Master?

03:22.800 --> 03:23.400
What did you say?

03:24.590 --> 03:26.190
Your Master was captured by Yu?

03:28.780 --> 03:29.550
Su Yishui,

03:29.579 --> 03:30.970
such an arrogant person,

03:30.990 --> 03:31.870
has finally met his downfall.

03:32.470 --> 03:34.120
He treated you horribly on the mountain.

03:34.840 --> 03:36.150
Why do you still care about him?

03:40.030 --> 03:40.750
Don't smile too wide.

03:41.680 --> 03:43.190
Be careful not to cut your face on the blade

03:43.590 --> 03:44.430
and get new scars.

03:46.750 --> 03:47.910
Yu captured him.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.230
It has nothing to do with me.

03:49.880 --> 03:50.810
Besides, those two

03:50.840 --> 03:51.960
never got alone to begin with.

03:55.240 --> 03:56.520
Could it be because

03:57.000 --> 03:58.030
I went to Mount Wester

03:58.800 --> 03:59.750
and Yu got jealous?

04:02.430 --> 04:03.710
If you dare to hurt me,

04:04.560 --> 04:06.360
Yu definitely won't let you two off the hook.

04:07.310 --> 04:08.240
Is it really

04:09.000 --> 04:10.190
that fun to deceive yourself?

04:12.560 --> 04:13.870
Since I entered the palace,

04:14.570 --> 04:15.410
I've been enjoying

04:15.590 --> 04:16.950
the treatment of a Crown Princess.

04:18.720 --> 04:19.829
In this world,

04:19.829 --> 04:20.870
the one he truly likes

04:21.290 --> 04:22.120
is me,

04:23.160 --> 04:24.310
and can only be me.

04:25.430 --> 04:26.070
I don't have time

04:26.070 --> 04:27.000
to argue with you, madwoman.

04:44.360 --> 04:45.190
Madam Battle,

04:45.630 --> 04:47.270
there's only half a bottle of the scar-removing

04:48.120 --> 04:49.750
Hundred Flower Dew you requested.

04:51.040 --> 04:51.920
Fortunately, I prepared some

04:51.920 --> 04:53.270
disguise talismans that don't require spiritual power.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.000
Even if I enter the palace,

04:55.600 --> 04:56.600
I won't be afraid of being exposed.

04:58.000 --> 04:59.070
I have failed in my service.

04:59.090 --> 05:00.070
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

05:00.160 --> 05:01.070
I will go outside immediately

05:01.070 --> 05:02.310
to find more Hundred Flower Dew.

05:02.950 --> 05:03.630
There's no need.

05:04.040 --> 05:04.720
Let's return to the palace.

05:07.270 --> 05:07.800
Yes.

05:07.990 --> 05:08.960
I will prepare it right away.

05:20.560 --> 05:21.470
Ranran has succeeded.

05:22.240 --> 05:22.750
Let's wait until nighttime

05:22.750 --> 05:23.870
when the guards on the street are more relaxed.

05:24.600 --> 05:25.920
We'll find a way to get close to the Eastern Palace

05:26.040 --> 05:27.040
to be ready to assist Ranran at any time.

05:34.159 --> 05:34.680
Stop.

05:37.630 --> 05:38.270
Madam Battle,

05:38.630 --> 05:39.390
His Highness ordered

05:39.570 --> 05:40.690
that everyone entering or leaving the Eastern Palace

05:40.720 --> 05:41.720
must be thoroughly checked.

05:42.750 --> 05:43.360
I apologize for the inconvenience.

05:53.310 --> 05:54.120
Have you seen enough?

05:55.659 --> 05:56.210
I apologize,

05:56.240 --> 05:56.800
Madam Battle.

06:15.260 --> 06:17.200
[Inquiry Pond]

06:18.510 --> 06:19.430
Isn't this where Master

06:19.430 --> 06:20.630
disappeared from?

06:21.800 --> 06:22.360
Stop.

06:24.160 --> 06:24.750
Horse stool.

06:30.270 --> 06:31.310
You don't need to follow me anymore.

06:32.310 --> 06:33.240
-Yes.
-Yes.

06:54.390 --> 06:55.830
I can't gather even a bit of spiritual power.

06:56.830 --> 06:58.040
The formation in this palace

06:58.310 --> 06:59.720
is even more powerful than I imagined.

07:00.810 --> 07:01.980
No wonder Master is trapped.

07:16.920 --> 07:17.870
Why are you still here?

07:19.040 --> 07:19.560
Could it be

07:19.870 --> 07:21.260
that wealth and status have gone to your head?

07:22.430 --> 07:23.950
This person's aura...

07:24.510 --> 07:25.870
Could she be an enemy from the palace?

07:27.360 --> 07:28.560
Better to avoid trouble.

07:31.950 --> 07:33.000
What's wrong?

07:34.040 --> 07:35.600
Why do you insist on staying in the palace?

07:37.360 --> 07:38.270
Haven't you learned your lesson

07:38.430 --> 07:39.510
from the last attack?

07:39.830 --> 07:40.750
The court intrigue

07:40.750 --> 07:41.750
is merciless.

07:42.070 --> 07:43.430
The Crown Prince can't protect you at all.

07:43.800 --> 07:45.750
Staying in the palace means risking your life.

07:46.270 --> 07:47.470
If you have nowhere to stay,

07:47.800 --> 07:48.360
my father

07:48.390 --> 07:49.600
has a villa in Ancheng in the northwest.

07:50.000 --> 07:51.240
You can go there to rest and recuperate.

07:51.800 --> 07:53.390
She's showing concern for me.

07:53.950 --> 07:55.870
Could she be someone I knew in a past life?

07:56.680 --> 07:57.920
She doesn't seem to have any ill intentions.

07:58.190 --> 07:58.750
Why don't I

07:59.190 --> 08:00.190
use her as a breakthrough?

08:01.600 --> 08:04.160
Su Yishui has been captured in the Eastern Palace.

08:04.750 --> 08:05.430
Did you know?

08:06.040 --> 08:07.040
Su Yishui has been captured?

08:08.750 --> 08:09.720
The commotion in the palace just now

08:09.750 --> 08:10.830
was caused by him?

08:11.800 --> 08:12.270
However,

08:12.560 --> 08:13.310
isn't that just as well?

08:13.700 --> 08:14.650
Why would you care

08:14.680 --> 08:15.560
about someone ungrateful

08:15.920 --> 08:16.920
like Su Yishui?

08:17.480 --> 08:19.000
You should stay far away

08:19.270 --> 08:20.120
from all this.

08:20.870 --> 08:22.070
She doesn't know anything.

08:22.560 --> 08:24.040
And she has a deep misunderstanding of Master.

08:24.480 --> 08:25.430
It seems she won't help me.

08:26.160 --> 08:26.600
Master!

08:27.800 --> 08:29.160
Greetings to you.

08:32.200 --> 08:32.840
Concubine Zhou,

08:33.320 --> 08:34.510
why have you come here?

08:35.100 --> 08:35.690
Minister Zhou

08:35.750 --> 08:37.390
is waiting outside your palace.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.030
Carefully rethink

08:42.390 --> 08:43.390
what I just told you.

08:53.030 --> 08:54.440
Who does she think she is?

08:56.080 --> 08:56.550
Master,

08:57.030 --> 08:58.360
Concubine Zhou's father, Minister Zhou,

08:58.440 --> 09:00.250
has recently had political disagreements with the Crown Prince.

09:00.360 --> 09:01.840
It looks like they're about to fall out of favor,

09:02.160 --> 09:03.520
so she's come here to you

09:03.550 --> 09:04.670
to curry favor and play tricks.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.510
Master, please don't be deceived by her,

09:06.800 --> 09:07.290
lest

09:07.320 --> 09:08.600
you get implicated by this father and daughter duo.

09:09.120 --> 09:09.550
Get out!

09:10.670 --> 09:11.150
Master?

09:11.600 --> 09:12.080
Master!

09:26.440 --> 09:27.670
Has there been anything unusual with the Winged Immortal

09:27.810 --> 09:28.540
under the Inquiry Pond?

09:28.870 --> 09:29.320
Rest assured.

09:29.630 --> 09:30.510
After the Immortal Master from the Exotic Pavilion

09:30.510 --> 09:31.320
cast the spell again,

09:31.550 --> 09:32.470
he's been very well-behaved now.

09:32.790 --> 09:33.670
He hasn't even surfaced.

09:34.960 --> 09:36.750
This faint spiritual energy...

09:37.360 --> 09:38.270
It seems to be Master.

09:39.540 --> 09:40.360
Your Highness, please stop.

09:40.870 --> 09:41.670
The Inquiry Pond is a forbidden area.

09:41.850 --> 09:42.550
His Highness has ordered

09:42.840 --> 09:44.030
that no one is allowed to approach it.

09:44.480 --> 09:45.030
I know.

09:45.690 --> 09:46.960
I just heard

09:46.960 --> 09:48.510
that there was something unusual at the Inquiry Pond.

09:49.240 --> 09:49.750
How is it now?

09:50.240 --> 09:51.290
It was just an assassin

09:51.320 --> 09:52.240
who slipped and fell in.

09:52.490 --> 09:53.940
We haven't even found the body yet.

09:54.590 --> 09:56.230
That energy just now was indeed Master.

09:57.120 --> 09:59.240
Master's voice seemed to be in pain.

09:59.360 --> 10:00.080
He's in danger.

10:01.000 --> 10:01.480
Your Highness,

10:01.800 --> 10:02.560
please leave.

10:15.000 --> 10:16.550
I don't know how Master is doing.

10:17.630 --> 10:19.510
I need to help him escape from the water quickly.

10:20.390 --> 10:21.840
But the guards here are strict.

10:22.390 --> 10:23.480
Those Immortal Masters from the Exotic Pavilion

10:23.480 --> 10:24.670
no longer carry badges.

10:25.510 --> 10:27.360
How can I secretly

10:27.390 --> 10:28.440
enter the water?

10:30.150 --> 10:30.750
Master!

10:37.440 --> 10:38.120
Master!

10:40.990 --> 10:42.270
Didn't I tell you all to go back?

10:42.440 --> 10:43.240
Why did you still enter the palace?

10:43.670 --> 10:44.670
You're in danger.

10:45.030 --> 10:46.480
How could we leave with peace of mind?

10:47.120 --> 10:47.870
Don't worry.

10:48.080 --> 10:49.080
I snuck in secretly.

10:49.360 --> 10:50.000
I wasn't exposed.

10:50.600 --> 10:51.960
Why did you use the Soul Control Technique again?

10:52.320 --> 10:53.360
What exactly happened?

10:53.510 --> 10:54.360
Are you hurt?

10:55.120 --> 10:56.080
Why are you so stubborn?

10:56.440 --> 10:57.510
Do I need you to save me?

10:57.840 --> 10:58.840
My life isn't in danger.

10:59.150 --> 11:00.360
Everything is within my plan.

11:00.630 --> 11:01.390
Quickly go back.

11:02.020 --> 11:02.930
But I clearly saw them

11:02.960 --> 11:04.240
force you into the pond.

11:04.480 --> 11:05.670
Now there's a lockdown everywhere.

11:06.080 --> 11:06.870
What's your plan?

11:07.120 --> 11:07.750
I can help you.

11:10.080 --> 11:11.720
Do I need to report my affairs to you?

11:12.480 --> 11:13.120
Didn't I

11:13.120 --> 11:14.150
make myself clear enough before?

11:14.600 --> 11:15.480
Our grievances are settled.

11:15.510 --> 11:16.150
We have no more connection.

11:16.790 --> 11:18.200
Who told you to be so presumptuous?

11:20.080 --> 11:21.080
I now officially announce

11:21.600 --> 11:23.120
that I'm expelling you, this rebellious disciple, from Mount Wester.

11:23.600 --> 11:24.600
We shall never meet again.

11:25.240 --> 11:25.910
Hurry up and leave.

11:29.360 --> 11:30.960
Only the Master can expel their disciple.

11:31.600 --> 11:32.960
How can a disciple expel their Master?

11:35.320 --> 11:36.000
What did you say?

11:42.620 --> 11:43.870
Rebellious disciple Su Yishui,

11:46.550 --> 11:48.030
is this how you speak to your Master?

11:48.750 --> 11:49.840
Correct your attitude.

11:52.840 --> 11:53.360
Qing—

11:55.240 --> 11:56.080
Qingge?

11:59.240 --> 12:00.270
You finally admit

12:01.080 --> 12:02.270
that I am Mu Qingge.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.080
You—

12:07.000 --> 12:08.480
When did you regain your memory?

12:08.870 --> 12:09.910
Do you remember

12:10.140 --> 12:11.260
who hurt and harmed you in your past life?

12:13.170 --> 12:13.790
About the past,

12:13.810 --> 12:15.240
I haven't been able to fully recall yet.

12:16.060 --> 12:16.880
But in the study,

12:16.910 --> 12:18.080
I saw the portrait you painted.

12:18.750 --> 12:20.440
I've already asked Mr. Zeng about everything.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.000
Raising your Master as a disciple

12:23.440 --> 12:24.550
is such an unorthodox act.

12:24.840 --> 12:26.080
If the Heavenly Sects knew about this,

12:26.480 --> 12:27.750
their jaws would drop.

12:31.390 --> 12:32.390
You kept it from everyone

12:33.120 --> 12:34.240
and kept me in the dark as well.

12:35.390 --> 12:36.080
Didn't you say

12:36.770 --> 12:37.690
the person you love most

12:37.720 --> 12:38.600
is Mu Qingge?

12:39.270 --> 12:39.960
That's me.

12:41.120 --> 12:42.720
Why did you hide from me and leave?

12:46.840 --> 12:47.870
You don't dare answer, right?

12:48.960 --> 12:50.320
For the questions you can't answer,

12:51.240 --> 12:52.870
I think I already know the answers.

12:56.240 --> 12:57.320
It's just like what I saw

12:57.320 --> 12:58.240
in your spiritual sense.

12:59.440 --> 13:00.360
For these 19 years,

13:01.000 --> 13:02.150
you've been confining yourself.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.550
Because of the guilt in your heart,

13:05.280 --> 13:06.440
you've sentenced yourself

13:07.150 --> 13:08.630
and sentenced our relationship.

13:09.750 --> 13:10.670
But you forgot.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.360
It was you who used the Golden Core to help me reborn.

13:14.320 --> 13:15.240
It was you who accompanied me

13:15.240 --> 13:16.320
and took care of me with your spiritual soul.

13:17.030 --> 13:18.150
It was also you who entered the Marrow-Cleansing Pool

13:18.480 --> 13:19.670
to help me form my core at the cost of

13:19.670 --> 13:20.440
ruining your cultivation.

13:24.840 --> 13:26.200
Even if there were any mistakes in the past,

13:27.000 --> 13:28.240
everything you've done now

13:28.790 --> 13:30.030
has been an effort to make amends.

13:32.510 --> 13:33.000
It's not enough.

13:34.640 --> 13:35.800
My debt to you

13:36.750 --> 13:38.390
can never be repaid, no matter what I do.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.360
We can discuss these

13:42.780 --> 13:43.720
old matters later.

13:44.320 --> 13:45.200
Right now, we have more pressing issues.

13:45.630 --> 13:47.150
Tell me quickly how I can help you.

13:48.240 --> 13:48.630
No need.

13:49.360 --> 13:50.200
Everything is fine underwater.

13:50.910 --> 13:51.790
But I still have matters to attend to.

13:52.270 --> 13:53.360
I can't leave the palace for now.

13:54.370 --> 13:54.890
Besides,

13:54.960 --> 13:55.840
my life is not in danger.

13:56.720 --> 13:57.510
You should return to Mount Wester first.

13:57.870 --> 13:59.120
I'll come find you after I've finished my business.

13:59.600 --> 14:00.550
You're lying again.

14:01.330 --> 14:02.330
You just want to hide it from me

14:02.360 --> 14:03.510
and seal the Spirit Spring alone.

14:03.910 --> 14:05.320
But you fell from the Transcendence Realm for me.

14:05.870 --> 14:06.570
After sealing the Spirit Spring,

14:06.600 --> 14:07.750
you'll never be able to come back.

14:11.200 --> 14:12.840
You always say that the former Mu Qingge

14:13.270 --> 14:14.480
shouldn't have disregarded your wishes

14:14.870 --> 14:15.910
to atone for your sins.

14:17.410 --> 14:19.010
But you're doing all this behind my back,

14:19.870 --> 14:21.050
leaving me to bear the pain

14:21.080 --> 14:21.790
for the rest of my life.

14:22.150 --> 14:23.440
Isn't that just as hateful?

14:24.600 --> 14:25.790
If you could remember everything,

14:26.030 --> 14:26.960
you wouldn't think so.

14:28.080 --> 14:29.320
You don't remember anything now.

14:30.080 --> 14:31.390
You have no right to forgive my past.

14:32.100 --> 14:33.050
Then we can talk about

14:33.080 --> 14:34.080
how to settle things at that time.

14:35.000 --> 14:35.750
I am who I am,

14:36.360 --> 14:37.550
yet I'm not myself anymore.

14:38.360 --> 14:39.600
After being reborn, I haven't lived

14:39.960 --> 14:41.000
these 19 years in vain.

14:41.440 --> 14:42.790
Why stay trapped in the past?

14:43.630 --> 14:44.910
I've asked Liang Wumeng about it.

14:45.270 --> 14:46.240
In the Xuantian Teachings,

14:46.400 --> 14:48.110
there's a method to restore the spiritual soul.

14:48.900 --> 14:49.970
Let's take this chance together.

14:50.240 --> 14:51.550
At least we can fight for a future.

14:52.960 --> 14:53.840
You wouldn't even have the courage

14:53.870 --> 14:54.840
to wait for me to regain my memories,

14:54.840 --> 14:55.360
would you?

14:56.040 --> 14:57.200
You said you'd let me judge

14:57.440 --> 14:58.270
and punish you.

14:58.870 --> 14:59.840
Was it all a lie?

15:04.900 --> 15:05.440
But...

15:05.460 --> 15:06.280
I am the Master.

15:06.840 --> 15:07.510
Listen to me.

15:08.430 --> 15:09.330
Tell me quickly

15:09.360 --> 15:10.200
what your plan is now.

15:10.670 --> 15:11.510
I will definitely help you.

15:14.790 --> 15:15.790
The Xuantian Teachings are...

15:16.620 --> 15:17.390
Master!

15:20.550 --> 15:22.080
Why did he leave before finishing?

15:24.030 --> 15:25.360
Could it be that this Soul Control Technique

15:25.670 --> 15:26.790
consumes too much spiritual power?

15:28.000 --> 15:28.720
I need to go quickly

15:28.720 --> 15:30.270
to check the situation underwater.

15:32.270 --> 15:33.080
Madam Battle!

15:33.960 --> 15:34.790
Madam Battle,

15:35.140 --> 15:36.180
where are you?

15:41.070 --> 15:44.150
[Madam Battle's Palace]

15:53.650 --> 15:54.570
This place is surprisingly not affected

15:54.600 --> 15:55.720
by the Eastern Palace's formation.

15:56.840 --> 15:57.360
That's great.

15:58.790 --> 15:59.670
All of you, leave now.

16:00.200 --> 16:00.870
I'm a bit tired.

16:01.600 --> 16:02.480
I don't want to be disturbed.

16:03.120 --> 16:04.080
Come back to clean up tomorrow.

16:05.030 --> 16:05.550
Yes.

16:35.150 --> 16:37.150
It's perfect to catalyze Divine Tree here.

16:37.840 --> 16:38.240
Divine Tree,

16:39.030 --> 16:40.390
it's all up to you whether I can break this Eastern Palace formation

16:40.720 --> 16:41.320
or not.

17:13.240 --> 17:14.349
Indeed, the study is a restricted area.

17:14.640 --> 17:15.680
The defensive formation is also stronger.

17:23.520 --> 17:24.130
He is indeed

17:24.160 --> 17:25.880
a diligent Crown Prince regent.

17:26.680 --> 17:27.270
What a pity.

17:44.750 --> 17:45.720
Hurry up, hurry up!

17:45.790 --> 17:47.000
What are you dawdling for?

17:47.680 --> 17:48.400
While Zhou Feihua

17:48.400 --> 17:49.240
is still at the training ground,

17:49.440 --> 17:50.510
quickly get him to bed.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.160
Young Master,

17:51.310 --> 17:52.170
what if we get

17:52.200 --> 17:52.790
discovered?

17:53.110 --> 17:53.960
How is that possible?

17:54.240 --> 17:55.790
I've already bribed her maid.

17:56.070 --> 17:56.920
Someone will soon

17:56.920 --> 17:57.720
go to the Crown Prince

17:58.110 --> 17:58.920
and tell him

17:59.510 --> 18:01.270
that Zhou Feihua wants to meet him.

18:01.790 --> 18:02.200
Young Master,

18:02.220 --> 18:03.030
that's a clever move.

18:03.160 --> 18:03.680
Hurry up, hurry up!

18:08.210 --> 18:09.930
You said someone fell into the water in the palace today.

18:10.830 --> 18:12.270
Did you see the body float up?

18:12.720 --> 18:14.220
The area around the pond has been guarded constantly.

18:14.400 --> 18:15.440
I couldn't get close.

18:15.930 --> 18:16.890
Mr. Zhou has been investigating for so long,

18:16.920 --> 18:17.830
but there are still no clues.

18:18.440 --> 18:19.350
Perhaps

18:19.720 --> 18:21.200
the story about monsters in the water

18:21.830 --> 18:22.750
is really just a rumor.

18:24.070 --> 18:25.240
This matter is of great importance.

18:25.640 --> 18:27.150
If we don't get to the bottom of it,

18:27.480 --> 18:28.440
it's worrying.

18:29.680 --> 18:30.720
Go and keep watch again.

18:31.300 --> 18:31.750
Yes.

18:33.890 --> 18:35.690
She's also investigating the monsters in the Inquiry Pond.

18:59.750 --> 19:00.350
Who are you?

19:04.000 --> 19:04.880
Don't be alarmed, My Lady.

19:05.310 --> 19:06.510
I'm just an ordinary palace maid.

19:06.960 --> 19:08.160
I saw that someone was trying to harm you

19:08.310 --> 19:09.110
and couldn't stand by,

19:09.310 --> 19:10.110
so I came to inform you.

19:13.100 --> 19:14.790
[There's a man in your bed. Quickly take care of this.]

19:16.350 --> 19:16.960
What's going on?

19:17.680 --> 19:18.790
It's all Lin Yeting's doing.

19:19.270 --> 19:20.200
There's no time to waste.

19:20.550 --> 19:21.480
If you don't believe me,

19:21.550 --> 19:22.750
you can go back to your chambers and see for yourself.

19:23.110 --> 19:24.350
Don't waste time here with me.

19:26.070 --> 19:26.440
No.

19:29.960 --> 19:30.880
You have to come with me.

19:31.350 --> 19:31.880
Otherwise,

19:32.550 --> 19:33.550
I'll call for guards right now.

19:46.000 --> 19:47.000
Now do you believe me?

19:47.510 --> 19:48.590
The Crown Prince's people are coming soon.

19:58.230 --> 19:59.440
Everything you said was true.

20:04.830 --> 20:05.550
Concubine Zhou.

20:07.000 --> 20:07.550
What is it?

20:08.480 --> 20:09.030
My Lady,

20:09.320 --> 20:10.780
after His Highness finishes his official duties,

20:10.830 --> 20:11.960
he wishes to come and visit you.

20:12.240 --> 20:13.310
I've come specially to inform you.

20:13.830 --> 20:14.960
Please convey to His Highness

20:15.200 --> 20:16.480
that I am feeling unwell today

20:16.510 --> 20:17.310
and need to rest.

20:17.550 --> 20:18.510
Please ask for His Highness's understanding.

20:19.640 --> 20:20.070
Yes,

20:20.550 --> 20:21.680
I will relay your message right away.

20:22.350 --> 20:23.410
His Highness heard that

20:23.440 --> 20:24.640
you have been in low spirits lately.

20:25.110 --> 20:26.170
He specially ordered someone to select

20:26.200 --> 20:28.200
wind chimes offered as tribute from the Western Regions.

20:28.400 --> 20:29.960
They have a calming effect on the mind and spirit.

20:31.510 --> 20:32.240
Hang them up, then.

20:32.590 --> 20:33.070
Yes.

20:39.000 --> 20:40.000
The Crown Prince favors you.

20:40.310 --> 20:40.880
My Lady,

20:41.030 --> 20:41.960
why aren't you happy about it?

20:43.270 --> 20:44.400
His Highness's favor

20:44.960 --> 20:46.200
is just like these wind chimes.

20:46.880 --> 20:47.750
All style and no substance.

20:49.000 --> 20:50.400
It has certainly made me

20:50.960 --> 20:52.240
many enemies in this palace.

20:53.310 --> 20:54.680
Now that your matter has been resolved,

20:55.160 --> 20:56.030
I shall take my leave.

20:57.070 --> 20:57.640
Wait.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.480
The selection of palace maids for the Eastern Palace

21:00.790 --> 21:02.000
has always been under my management.

21:02.510 --> 21:04.270
How could I have no impression of you?

21:04.590 --> 21:05.510
Who are you really?

21:06.070 --> 21:07.000
If you don't tell the truth,

21:07.440 --> 21:08.440
I'll really call for guards.

21:10.200 --> 21:11.400
I'm indeed not a palace maid,

21:12.200 --> 21:13.240
but I have no ill intentions.

21:13.830 --> 21:14.270
My Lady,

21:14.550 --> 21:15.000
considering I just

21:15.000 --> 21:16.510
saved your life, could you

21:17.000 --> 21:18.110
let me off just this once?

21:19.160 --> 21:20.240
If you're not up to no good,

21:20.830 --> 21:21.920
do you dare to explain your purpose?

21:23.790 --> 21:24.640
If I can help,

21:25.070 --> 21:26.030
I'll certainly do my duty.

21:27.270 --> 21:28.510
I am Su Yishui's disciple.

21:28.960 --> 21:29.590
I entered the palace

21:29.750 --> 21:31.400
to save my Master who fell into the Inquiry Pond.

21:32.110 --> 21:32.960
Su Yishui?

21:34.400 --> 21:35.640
He killed his own Master.

21:36.270 --> 21:37.350
How could he have

21:37.680 --> 21:39.350
such a loyal disciple like you?

21:39.550 --> 21:41.400
My Lady, you might have a bias against my Master,

21:41.590 --> 21:42.830
but everything I said was true.

21:43.310 --> 21:44.920
The capital has been experiencing unusual weather for months,

21:45.120 --> 21:45.890
and there have been repeated incidents

21:45.920 --> 21:47.270
of cultivators having their pills stolen.

21:47.860 --> 21:48.820
After my Master investigated,

21:49.130 --> 21:50.480
he suspected it was related to the Eastern Palace,

21:50.770 --> 21:52.050
but he got trapped in the Inquiry Pond.

21:53.070 --> 21:53.510
He must have been

21:53.510 --> 21:54.680
trapped by the monster in the water.

21:55.480 --> 21:56.310
I have to save him.

21:57.750 --> 21:59.960
There really is a monster hidden in the Inquiry Pond?

22:00.920 --> 22:01.510
So it's true.

22:02.310 --> 22:03.680
Do you know something about this?

22:04.200 --> 22:04.790
Before,

22:05.960 --> 22:07.200
one of my father's subordinates

22:07.720 --> 22:09.640
was passing by the palace waterway late at night...

22:17.510 --> 22:18.110
Later,

22:18.590 --> 22:20.240
my father went to investigate the waterway

22:20.920 --> 22:22.110
but found nothing.

22:22.880 --> 22:23.440
Considering that

22:23.440 --> 22:25.200
the waterway is connected to the Inquiry Pond,

22:25.830 --> 22:27.070
he requested permission from the Crown Prince

22:27.400 --> 22:28.240
to open the Inquiry Pond

22:28.350 --> 22:29.160
for a joint investigation,

22:30.590 --> 22:31.920
but he was firmly refused.

22:33.070 --> 22:34.440
Later, that subordinate

22:34.550 --> 22:35.620
fell into the river due to drunkenness

22:35.750 --> 22:36.960
and drowned.

22:37.590 --> 22:39.150
Someone must have killed him

22:39.310 --> 22:40.160
to cover up the secret.

22:40.960 --> 22:42.310
The more they want to keep it hidden,

22:42.480 --> 22:43.240
the more dangerous it is.

22:44.110 --> 22:45.240
I must go down to the Inquiry Pond

22:45.270 --> 22:45.960
and investigate thoroughly.

22:46.810 --> 22:47.890
Is it worth taking such a risk

22:47.920 --> 22:48.640
for someone

22:49.200 --> 22:49.920
like Su Yishui?

22:50.710 --> 22:52.710
People have many misunderstandings about my Master,

22:53.070 --> 22:54.350
but I know in my heart

22:54.890 --> 22:55.650
that he is the person

22:55.680 --> 22:56.640
who has been the kindest to me in this world.

22:57.480 --> 22:58.680
Now he's all alone,

22:58.790 --> 22:59.720
without any hope.

23:00.240 --> 23:00.920
Other than me,

23:01.160 --> 23:02.240
who else can save him?

23:07.110 --> 23:08.160
He's all alone,

23:08.590 --> 23:09.400
without any hope.

23:10.110 --> 23:11.400
I can give him a hand.

23:12.070 --> 23:13.200
Who else is willing to save him?

23:15.590 --> 23:16.310
I never thought

23:17.350 --> 23:19.240
that after enduring over a decade in this deep palace,

23:19.790 --> 23:20.270
I've become

23:20.270 --> 23:21.720
more cautious in my actions.

23:23.200 --> 23:23.790
Originally,

23:24.040 --> 23:25.240
I had planned to go to the Inquiry Pond

23:25.270 --> 23:26.240
to get to the bottom of things.

23:27.270 --> 23:27.790
How could I possibly

23:27.790 --> 23:29.160
have second thoughts just because

23:29.550 --> 23:30.640
you're Su Yishui's disciple?

23:31.960 --> 23:32.430
Alright,

23:33.000 --> 23:34.110
I can help you this time.

23:37.270 --> 23:37.960
Guards!

23:38.200 --> 23:38.880
There's an assassin!

23:39.030 --> 23:39.640
Where's the assassin?

23:39.960 --> 23:40.750
They went that way!

23:41.030 --> 23:41.680
Search for them!

23:41.750 --> 23:42.110
Hurry!

23:42.200 --> 23:42.550
Let's go!

23:43.270 --> 23:43.750
Wait.

23:45.030 --> 23:46.030
Perhaps I was mistaken.

23:46.110 --> 23:47.270
Let's not make such a big commotion,

23:47.510 --> 23:48.650
lest we disturb the Crown Prince.

23:49.160 --> 23:49.550
Yes.

23:49.750 --> 23:50.160
Yes.

23:50.680 --> 23:51.400
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

24:09.560 --> 24:10.290
What's going on?

24:17.510 --> 24:18.590
The malicious energy in this water runs deep.

24:18.880 --> 24:19.880
Mortal flesh

24:20.200 --> 24:21.790
will be corroded by the malicious energy if you go in.

24:23.730 --> 24:24.800
Then Su Yishui's body

24:24.830 --> 24:25.750
has been in this water all along.

24:26.110 --> 24:27.200
Isn't that dangerous?

24:27.750 --> 24:28.640
Wait for me on the shore.

24:28.920 --> 24:29.450
But...

24:29.480 --> 24:30.200
To be honest,

24:30.440 --> 24:31.200
my body is a Fruit.

24:31.440 --> 24:32.790
This malicious energy doesn't affect me much.

24:33.000 --> 24:33.750
I'll be back soon.

24:36.070 --> 24:36.680
What?

24:37.480 --> 24:38.310
Fruit?

24:44.480 --> 24:45.960
The malicious energy in this water is so strong.

24:46.640 --> 24:47.880
Will Master be alright?

25:11.840 --> 25:12.880
So you do know fear.

25:13.920 --> 25:15.310
You shouldn't have recklessly taken risks.

25:20.960 --> 25:22.240
I was not afraid of the dragon.

25:22.550 --> 25:24.030
I was scared you'll be in trouble.

25:24.990 --> 25:25.670
Master,

25:26.200 --> 25:27.640
why did you use the Soul Control Technique

25:28.110 --> 25:29.640
to control this Green Dragon?

25:30.400 --> 25:31.110
This is the dragon egg

25:31.110 --> 25:32.240
that Meng Zhang lost.

25:34.270 --> 25:35.110
It's this one?

25:40.000 --> 25:40.720
It was supposed to

25:40.720 --> 25:41.720
incubate for 100 years before hatching.

25:42.720 --> 25:43.240
But Su Yu

25:43.240 --> 25:44.440
fed it countless inner pills

25:45.000 --> 25:46.400
and nourished it with Resentment Liquid,

25:46.670 --> 25:47.910
forcing it to transform prematurely.

25:48.640 --> 25:49.640
It has also developed a devilish nature.

25:50.720 --> 25:51.310
I should have

25:51.310 --> 25:52.400
immediately sent it back to Dragon Island

25:52.510 --> 25:53.240
and undo the soul oath.

25:53.950 --> 25:55.220
But its malicious energy is too strong right now.

25:55.830 --> 25:57.160
My spiritual power is currently limited.

25:57.510 --> 25:58.590
With my current abilities,

25:59.030 --> 25:59.920
I can hardly protect myself,

26:00.290 --> 26:01.660
let alone prevent the young dragon from causing chaos.

26:02.440 --> 26:03.270
This is the first reason.

26:04.030 --> 26:04.640
Moreover,

26:05.270 --> 26:06.590
after searching far and wide,

26:07.070 --> 26:08.000
I discovered something

26:08.030 --> 26:08.830
on the Green Dragon.

26:09.400 --> 26:10.000
What is it?

26:10.750 --> 26:11.640
The Xuantian Teachings.

26:14.000 --> 26:14.720
Su Yu originally

26:14.720 --> 26:16.070
used it as a magical tool to control the dragon,

26:16.750 --> 26:18.200
but unexpectedly, the dragon swallowed it.

26:18.750 --> 26:20.240
I'm trying to retrieve it.

26:20.920 --> 26:21.920
I see.

26:22.930 --> 26:23.970
It seems all the key points

26:24.000 --> 26:25.310
are related to the young Green Dragon.

26:26.480 --> 26:27.070
However,

26:27.640 --> 26:29.170
why would Su Yu take the risk

26:29.400 --> 26:30.880
of trapping the young Green Dragon in the palace?

26:31.830 --> 26:32.720
Su Yu's life is coming to an end.

26:33.400 --> 26:34.070
He's raising the dragon

26:34.070 --> 26:35.550
to extend his own lifespan.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.160
What?

26:38.110 --> 26:39.440
It was only after I possessed the Green Dragon

26:39.830 --> 26:41.160
and shared its senses that I learned

26:41.920 --> 26:43.200
Su Yu has long been poisoned

26:43.480 --> 26:44.270
and is on the verge of death.

26:44.960 --> 26:45.830
I guess he plans

26:45.830 --> 26:46.920
to use the Seven Evil Transformation Spell

26:47.240 --> 26:48.200
to merge with the Green Dragon

26:48.680 --> 26:49.920
and gain its 1,000-year lifespan.

26:50.680 --> 26:52.030
To extend his own life,

26:52.540 --> 26:53.970
he's willing to put all the people in the imperial city

26:54.000 --> 26:55.200
in danger?

26:56.170 --> 26:57.040
We must hurry

26:57.070 --> 26:57.830
to rescue

26:57.960 --> 26:58.680
the young Green Dragon

26:58.830 --> 26:59.550
and send it back to Dragon Island.

27:00.200 --> 27:01.110
That's exactly what I intend to do.

27:01.720 --> 27:02.350
However...

27:07.830 --> 27:09.270
Su Yu has trapped us with a formation.

27:10.130 --> 27:11.080
I need more spiritual power

27:11.110 --> 27:12.110
to break through the chains.

27:12.640 --> 27:13.110
Moreover,

27:13.510 --> 27:14.830
it will take six more days to purify the hostility.

27:15.350 --> 27:16.480
That day happens to be the Double Ninth Festival.

27:17.160 --> 27:17.720
I can take advantage of

27:17.750 --> 27:18.880
the noon energy of the Double Ninth Festival

27:19.110 --> 27:19.750
to accumulate spiritual power,

27:20.070 --> 27:21.110
control the dragon to break through the formation,

27:21.480 --> 27:22.240
ascend to the sky and enter the sea,

27:22.590 --> 27:23.270
and return to Dragon Island.

27:23.960 --> 27:24.510
But,

27:25.550 --> 27:26.830
Master, what about your body?

27:28.000 --> 27:29.310
Why haven't I seen it all this time?

27:29.960 --> 27:31.350
The malicious energy in the water burns people.

27:31.830 --> 27:32.310
I have

27:32.310 --> 27:33.270
hidden it in a safe place.

27:33.790 --> 27:34.310
Don't worry.

27:34.680 --> 27:35.680
Su Yu won't find it.

27:40.440 --> 27:40.880
Oh no.

27:41.200 --> 27:42.070
Master, what's wrong?

27:42.700 --> 27:43.610
Someone just used a spell

27:43.640 --> 27:44.960
to sever the connection between me and my mortal body.

27:45.590 --> 27:46.680
I can no longer sense my mortal body.

27:47.310 --> 27:47.920
What?

27:48.970 --> 27:49.690
Could it be that Su Yu

27:49.720 --> 27:50.640
couldn't find you anywhere,

27:51.070 --> 27:52.480
so he's using this method to force you to reveal yourself?

27:53.200 --> 27:53.850
But if the Soul Control Technique

27:53.880 --> 27:55.200
doesn't restore connection

27:55.400 --> 27:56.590
within 24 hours,

27:56.880 --> 27:58.400
you'll never be able to return to your mortal body.

27:59.960 --> 28:00.830
There is a way.

28:02.680 --> 28:03.680
If you place something that belongs to me

28:03.790 --> 28:04.830
near my body,

28:05.160 --> 28:06.270
I should be able to sense it again.

28:07.080 --> 28:07.640
Master,

28:08.510 --> 28:09.350
leave this to me.

28:10.790 --> 28:11.640
The palace is too dangerous.

28:12.200 --> 28:13.510
He has discovered your true identity

28:14.000 --> 28:15.400
and will stop at nothing to keep you there.

28:16.200 --> 28:16.720
Don't worry.

28:17.210 --> 28:18.280
I have Zhou Feihua now

28:18.310 --> 28:19.160
to help cover for me.

28:19.590 --> 28:20.790
I won't let Su Yu notice.

28:21.400 --> 28:23.030
Plus, I've almost figured out

28:23.350 --> 28:24.510
the underground formation of the Eastern Palace.

28:25.030 --> 28:25.640
Maybe

28:26.070 --> 28:27.310
I can break the formation early

28:27.590 --> 28:28.960
and restore your spiritual power, Master.

28:29.720 --> 28:31.000
You've always protected me before.

28:31.680 --> 28:32.270
Now,

28:32.680 --> 28:33.960
it's my turn to protect you.

28:36.110 --> 28:37.270
I really don't know what to do with you.

28:47.720 --> 28:48.920
You finally made it out alive.

28:49.110 --> 28:50.020
I was worried sick.

28:50.680 --> 28:51.440
Where's Su Yishui?

29:18.800 --> 29:19.320
What's this?

29:19.720 --> 29:20.960
I'll explain when we get back.

29:21.200 --> 29:21.680
Let's go quickly.

29:24.830 --> 29:25.960
The man-eating dragon in the water

29:26.550 --> 29:27.870
is actually raised by His Highness

29:28.000 --> 29:28.830
to extend his life?

29:34.180 --> 29:34.820
That's right.

29:35.790 --> 29:37.440
Once he uses the Seven Evil Transformation Spell

29:37.640 --> 29:38.920
and merges with the Green Dragon,

29:39.590 --> 29:40.920
he can borrow its lifespan

29:41.200 --> 29:43.030
but will also be controlled by the Green Dragon's malicious energy,

29:43.440 --> 29:44.240
losing his true nature.

29:44.640 --> 29:45.310
The consequences

29:45.350 --> 29:46.790
can't be withstood by the universe.

29:47.880 --> 29:48.590
I never thought

29:49.170 --> 29:50.650
the Crown Prince, who has always been diligent and loved his people,

29:51.070 --> 29:52.630
would become so obsessed.

29:54.350 --> 29:55.000
Once the human heart

29:55.160 --> 29:56.470
is controlled by obsession,

29:57.170 --> 29:58.850
it'll be hard to distinguish right from wrong.

30:02.640 --> 30:03.830
The reason I entered the palace

30:04.440 --> 30:06.160
was because my family promised Qingge

30:06.710 --> 30:07.800
to diligently protect and supervise the emperor.

30:08.750 --> 30:09.310
However,

30:10.240 --> 30:12.110
His Highness has done such a thing.

30:14.640 --> 30:16.480
I have failed to fulfill the wishes of the deceased.

30:17.720 --> 30:18.960
I truly feel guilty towards Qingge.

30:20.480 --> 30:21.720
For the sake of a promise,

30:22.060 --> 30:23.000
you've been persevering alone

30:23.030 --> 30:24.160
in the deep palace for so many years.

30:24.550 --> 30:25.680
That's already impressive.

30:26.070 --> 30:26.790
Plus,

30:26.920 --> 30:28.380
there's still hope.

30:29.110 --> 30:30.830
Once Master purifies the Green Dragon's malicious energy,

30:31.110 --> 30:33.000
he will ride the Green Dragon back to Dragon Island.

30:33.640 --> 30:34.600
You don't need to blame yourself.

30:40.640 --> 30:41.640
Young lady,

30:42.350 --> 30:43.510
you're quite good at comforting others.

30:45.360 --> 30:46.120
I don't know why,

30:46.720 --> 30:47.400
but you and I

30:48.030 --> 30:49.270
indeed hit it off at first sight.

30:49.680 --> 30:50.110
Oh no.

30:52.270 --> 30:52.830
What's wrong?

31:00.270 --> 31:01.960
The transformation rune got soaked and ruined in the water.

31:04.790 --> 31:06.110
It's inconvenient for me to move around in the palace.

31:06.590 --> 31:07.310
There's something

31:07.680 --> 31:08.640
I'd like your help with.

31:09.270 --> 31:10.310
Place something that belongs to me

31:10.440 --> 31:11.510
near my body.

31:18.350 --> 31:19.480
I thought it was something difficult.

31:20.030 --> 31:20.790
This is easy.

31:21.240 --> 31:21.720
Tell me,

31:22.400 --> 31:22.920
where should I put it?

31:23.510 --> 31:24.230
This place

31:24.510 --> 31:25.750
can only be known by you.

31:26.310 --> 31:27.720
Make sure no one else finds out.

31:44.640 --> 31:45.240
It's done.

31:46.680 --> 31:47.440
Great!

31:48.080 --> 31:48.650
Now Master

31:48.680 --> 31:49.830
can return to his body.

31:50.070 --> 31:50.720
Thank you.

31:53.270 --> 31:54.480
However, since you've helped us,

31:54.880 --> 31:56.270
if Su Yu finds out,

31:56.550 --> 31:57.590
you'll be implicated too.

31:57.960 --> 31:59.240
Why don't you wait until we return the Green Dragon

31:59.750 --> 32:00.920
and then leave the palace with me?

32:01.920 --> 32:02.510
Leave the palace?

32:03.680 --> 32:04.790
Do you like the Crown Prince?

32:10.510 --> 32:11.590
As human beings,

32:12.000 --> 32:12.880
how can there be no feelings

32:13.400 --> 32:14.480
after being together fo so long?

32:15.720 --> 32:16.510
It's just that

32:17.030 --> 32:17.830
in his heart,

32:18.400 --> 32:19.750
there has only ever been Qingge.

32:22.480 --> 32:23.400
I've long since stopped expecting

32:23.720 --> 32:24.960
any response from him.

32:26.830 --> 32:28.350
If the Green Dragon is released,

32:29.070 --> 32:30.030
His Highness's life

32:30.270 --> 32:31.440
might come to an end.

32:31.960 --> 32:33.070
After years of marriage,

32:33.440 --> 32:34.590
I'll accompany him through this final journey

32:34.920 --> 32:36.110
before thinking about the future.

32:37.160 --> 32:39.160
The Crown Prince has arrived.

32:51.250 --> 32:52.580
Your Highness, what brings you here?

32:57.640 --> 32:58.160
Your Highness,

32:58.720 --> 33:00.240
allowing this person into my private chambers

33:00.350 --> 33:01.160
seems inappropriate.

33:02.000 --> 33:03.510
My people can't enter,

33:04.590 --> 33:05.680
but outsiders

33:06.240 --> 33:07.000
can be hidden here?

33:09.440 --> 33:10.680
What do you mean by that, Your Highness?

33:11.070 --> 33:11.920
I don't understand.

33:15.310 --> 33:17.110
You help other men plot against me.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.160
Where does your heart truly lie,

33:20.030 --> 33:21.270
Concubine Zhou?

33:28.590 --> 33:29.240
How dare you!

33:32.680 --> 33:33.310
Ranran,

33:34.550 --> 33:35.510
since you're here,

33:36.310 --> 33:37.680
why hide?

33:38.880 --> 33:40.480
Or must I call you Qingge

33:42.640 --> 33:44.000
for you to acknowledge me?

33:45.790 --> 33:46.680
Qingge?

33:50.430 --> 33:51.730
Wait, don't hurt her!

33:52.360 --> 33:53.430
How did you know I was here?

33:55.350 --> 33:56.520
I not only know that,

33:56.750 --> 33:58.160
but I also know that you and Su Yishui

33:58.680 --> 34:00.110
plan to release my Green Dragon.

34:04.880 --> 34:05.640
A sound transmission talisman?

34:07.510 --> 34:08.630
You eavesdropped on our conversation.

34:09.800 --> 34:11.000
Su Yishui's plan

34:11.670 --> 34:12.710
was indeed well-calculated.

34:13.409 --> 34:13.989
Unfortunately,

34:15.320 --> 34:16.150
the Eastern Palace

34:18.000 --> 34:19.670
is my territory, after all.

34:21.760 --> 34:23.840
The malicious energy underwater is too strong.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.550
Su Yishui's mortal body

34:25.920 --> 34:27.030
certainly won't be hidden in the water.

34:27.710 --> 34:28.280
It's likely

34:29.070 --> 34:30.190
that he has already used magic

34:30.400 --> 34:31.320
to transport it back to shore.

34:31.710 --> 34:32.280
However,

34:32.670 --> 34:33.630
we can't find it anywhere.

34:35.150 --> 34:36.840
If he successfully releases the Green Dragon,

34:38.400 --> 34:39.110
wouldn't we

34:39.110 --> 34:40.110
lose both the person and the dragon?

34:42.550 --> 34:43.000
Don't worry.

34:43.510 --> 34:44.590
I can't find him,

34:45.000 --> 34:45.510
but

34:45.810 --> 34:46.600
I can sever

34:46.630 --> 34:47.760
his connection to his mortal body.

34:48.510 --> 34:49.590
Within 24 hours,

34:49.800 --> 34:51.000
he will certainly seek help

34:51.110 --> 34:52.150
to place his personal belongings

34:52.480 --> 34:53.840
within 10 steps of his mortal body.

34:54.760 --> 34:55.480
His disciple,

34:56.110 --> 34:57.230
knowing he's in danger,

34:57.550 --> 34:58.630
will surely not ignore it.

35:01.880 --> 35:02.400
Ranran.

35:05.280 --> 35:06.490
I will place

35:06.630 --> 35:07.630
eavesdropping wind chimes throughout the palace.

35:08.110 --> 35:08.960
We'll have no trouble finding him.

35:13.480 --> 35:13.840
Good.

35:19.710 --> 35:20.480
Is it done?

35:20.840 --> 35:21.230
It's done.

35:21.630 --> 35:22.230
Now Master

35:22.230 --> 35:23.360
can return to his body.

35:23.710 --> 35:24.320
Thank you.

35:24.630 --> 35:25.880
Zhou Feihua.

35:32.920 --> 35:33.550
How is it?

35:34.230 --> 35:34.510
Nothing.

35:35.110 --> 35:35.880
Report! Nothing.

35:36.400 --> 35:37.110
Nothing?

35:38.800 --> 35:39.110
Let's go.

35:47.070 --> 35:47.760
Have you found it?

35:48.480 --> 35:49.030
Your Highness,

35:49.550 --> 35:50.230
we've searched

35:50.510 --> 35:51.280
everywhere

35:51.760 --> 35:52.670
but couldn't find Su Yishui.

35:53.760 --> 35:54.400
Impossible.

35:55.080 --> 35:55.670
Could it be

35:55.670 --> 35:57.030
she secretly went somewhere else?

35:57.400 --> 35:58.110
Concubine Zhou's every move

35:58.110 --> 35:58.920
was under

35:59.070 --> 36:00.190
our supervision today.

36:00.920 --> 36:02.030
We've searched every place

36:02.360 --> 36:03.150
she passed by.

36:03.510 --> 36:04.840
It's absolutely impossible for Su Yishui to be hidden there.

36:07.150 --> 36:08.000
That's strange, then.

36:08.760 --> 36:10.400
Concubine Zhou must place his personal item

36:10.670 --> 36:11.510
near Su Yishui's

36:11.510 --> 36:12.710
mortal body for it to work.

36:13.230 --> 36:14.760
But all the places she's been to

36:14.890 --> 36:15.520
have been searched

36:15.550 --> 36:16.630
and Su Yishui wasn't found anywhere.

36:17.280 --> 36:17.710
Could it be...

36:17.800 --> 36:18.320
No.

36:19.920 --> 36:21.480
There's still one place we haven't searched.

36:23.010 --> 36:24.090
My study.

36:54.280 --> 36:54.760
My Lady.

36:55.440 --> 36:56.070
His Highness is busy.

36:56.440 --> 36:57.650
Remember to remind him to drink

36:57.710 --> 36:58.670
the calming tea these days.

36:59.110 --> 36:59.590
Yes.

38:16.630 --> 38:17.840
I've calculated everything,

38:19.000 --> 38:20.710
but I never thought he was right before me.

38:23.920 --> 38:25.400
You've got some skills,

38:26.760 --> 38:28.230
daring to play such tricks

38:29.030 --> 38:30.280
right under my nose.

38:32.290 --> 38:33.890
If you dare to harm even a single hair

38:33.920 --> 38:34.840
on my Master's body,

38:35.510 --> 38:37.030
I'll risk my life to make you pay.

38:37.070 --> 38:37.800
Don't worry,

38:38.960 --> 38:39.840
I wouldn't bear to

38:39.840 --> 38:40.880
damage this mortal body.

38:43.280 --> 38:43.960
What do you mean?

38:45.150 --> 38:45.880
What are you going to do?

38:46.020 --> 38:47.320
Although a dragon's life is long,

38:48.190 --> 38:49.480
it's ultimately not a human body.

38:50.000 --> 38:51.030
With a body like Su Yishui's

38:51.030 --> 38:52.000
in my possession,

38:53.360 --> 38:54.440
why shouldn't I use it?

38:56.070 --> 38:56.400
You...

38:58.320 --> 38:59.440
You're planning to possess his body?

39:03.410 --> 39:04.030
I thought

39:04.030 --> 39:05.710
you were a kind and humble person.

39:06.190 --> 39:07.510
I never expected that for the sake of extending your life,

39:07.880 --> 39:09.150
you would sacrifice living people.

39:09.630 --> 39:11.110
And now you're using evil magic to possess someone.

39:11.760 --> 39:12.510
By doing this,

39:12.710 --> 39:13.400
can you really face

39:13.400 --> 39:14.670
the civilians who adore you

39:14.960 --> 39:16.320
and your own conscience?

39:16.480 --> 39:17.550
Why can't I?

39:19.830 --> 39:21.110
I have done so much for the people

39:21.110 --> 39:22.070
of the universe,

39:23.280 --> 39:25.070
and made so many contributions to the court.

39:26.360 --> 39:27.800
Now that I'm about to die,

39:28.810 --> 39:29.640
why can't I

39:29.670 --> 39:31.030
ask them to give a little back to me?

39:36.760 --> 39:37.840
As long as I survive

39:38.590 --> 39:39.880
and successfully ascend to the throne,

39:40.360 --> 39:41.960
I will surely be a good emperor.

39:42.480 --> 39:44.000
By then, free from the troubles of illness,

39:44.960 --> 39:46.480
I can rule for thousands of years

39:47.590 --> 39:49.070
and benefit even more people.

39:50.360 --> 39:51.400
Isn't that better?

39:51.800 --> 39:52.800
Do you really think

39:53.150 --> 39:54.510
that after taking this evil path,

39:55.160 --> 39:56.370
you'll still be the

39:56.400 --> 39:57.960
benevolent ruler you think you are?

39:59.030 --> 40:00.060
Do the people of the universe

40:00.440 --> 40:01.440
really need someone like you

40:01.440 --> 40:02.360
to rule for thousands of years?

40:04.920 --> 40:06.280
You haven't changed a bit.

40:07.320 --> 40:09.070
Even if your appearance has slightly changed,

40:10.000 --> 40:11.800
you still won't say anything against your conscience.

40:13.510 --> 40:14.590
But I don't blame you.

40:15.510 --> 40:16.630
You've forgotten everything from the past.

40:16.930 --> 40:17.960
Now, you're just

40:17.960 --> 40:19.400
a 19-year-old girl.

40:20.290 --> 40:21.160
You don't understand.

40:22.110 --> 40:23.190
Those who achieve great things

40:23.710 --> 40:25.190
shouldn't be bound by trivial matters.

40:25.970 --> 40:26.770
Those who ascend to the throne

40:26.800 --> 40:28.150
and become a ruler

40:28.800 --> 40:29.800
all have

40:31.000 --> 40:32.360
some blood on their hands.

40:32.840 --> 40:34.360
I've really misjudged you.

40:35.190 --> 40:36.400
Misjudged me?

40:39.360 --> 40:40.510
You think that

40:40.510 --> 40:42.070
your beloved Master Su Yishui

40:42.880 --> 40:44.320
is so noble?

40:45.630 --> 40:46.510
You don't remember,

40:47.840 --> 40:49.000
so let me tell you.

40:51.510 --> 40:52.670
Su Yishui

40:53.760 --> 40:54.320
is the one who is

40:54.320 --> 40:55.760
the Demon's child, the source of all evil.

40:56.480 --> 40:56.920
He

40:57.800 --> 40:58.440
is the one who

40:58.440 --> 40:59.880
threatens all living beings!

41:00.630 --> 41:01.800
What threatens all living beings

41:02.240 --> 41:03.470
has always been the human heart.

41:04.320 --> 41:06.150
He was born as the Demon's child,

41:06.490 --> 41:07.370
controlled by those with ulterior motives

41:07.400 --> 41:08.400
and the Spirit Spring.

41:09.150 --> 41:10.150
But now you

41:10.630 --> 41:12.590
are choosing to do these evil deeds willingly.

41:15.390 --> 41:16.850
You're not surprised at all.

41:18.920 --> 41:19.590
You already knew

41:19.590 --> 41:20.760
that Su Yishui is the Demon's child.

41:21.230 --> 41:21.800
That's right.

41:22.630 --> 41:23.630
I know who he is

41:24.760 --> 41:26.000
and I know who I am.

41:28.030 --> 41:28.880
I can't remember

41:28.880 --> 41:29.800
the past very clearly,

41:30.710 --> 41:31.960
but I know myself well.

41:33.090 --> 41:34.290
Back then, I must have known

41:34.320 --> 41:35.280
that his true nature wasn't evil,

41:35.510 --> 41:37.070
so I did everything I could

41:37.190 --> 41:38.320
to help him separate from the Spirit Spring

41:38.400 --> 41:39.480
and bring him back to the righteous path.

41:40.280 --> 41:40.710
Similarly,

41:42.190 --> 41:43.190
it must have been because I knew

41:43.190 --> 41:44.150
that your nature was pure

41:44.890 --> 41:45.850
that I chose to

41:45.880 --> 41:47.000
help you and Prince Zong back then.

41:48.510 --> 41:49.880
But in the end, I was wrong.

41:54.410 --> 41:55.330
Since you already know

41:55.360 --> 41:56.590
that you are Mu Qingge,

41:58.120 --> 41:59.200
then you should know that

41:59.230 --> 42:00.800
it was Su Yishui who caused your death back then.

42:01.550 --> 42:02.360
But why

42:02.360 --> 42:03.400
don't you hate him at all?

42:04.330 --> 42:05.200
Just because he used

42:05.230 --> 42:06.480
half of his Golden Core in remorse

42:07.070 --> 42:08.440
to bring you back to life,

42:09.280 --> 42:10.800
you can forgive him for everything?

42:11.960 --> 42:12.880
I only know that

42:13.290 --> 42:14.770
he treats me well now

42:15.400 --> 42:16.670
and he's doing his best

42:16.840 --> 42:17.630
to seal the Spirit Spring.

42:18.320 --> 42:19.920
He's trying his hardest to be a good person.

42:20.480 --> 42:21.880
Don't those who truly repent

42:22.110 --> 42:23.150
deserve forgiveness?

42:24.960 --> 42:25.880
Repentance?

42:31.960 --> 42:33.550
Can repentance lead to forgiveness?

42:35.800 --> 42:36.670
Can repentance

42:39.480 --> 42:40.760
start everything anew?

42:46.110 --> 42:47.360
Then I have regrets too.

42:50.440 --> 42:51.360
I regret that back then,

42:51.360 --> 42:53.190
even though you came to me first,

42:55.230 --> 42:56.360
I still sent you to save

42:56.400 --> 42:57.800
my ungrateful second brother.

42:59.440 --> 43:00.550
If it weren't for that,

43:01.760 --> 43:02.630
I wouldn't have pushed you

43:02.710 --> 43:03.960
to Su Yishui's side.

43:07.230 --> 43:08.230
But in the end,

43:10.800 --> 43:11.670
what did I get?

43:14.230 --> 43:15.630
What I got was the poison

43:15.670 --> 43:17.280
my second brother secretly delivered.

43:19.400 --> 43:20.480
What I got was

43:21.960 --> 43:23.630
his attempt to seize the position of Crown Prince,

43:25.590 --> 43:27.000
giving me this health

43:27.030 --> 43:28.590
that's worse than death.
